    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d807-a2">

                <pb facs="0510" n="1628" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v15p2/pg1628"/>

                <head>Appendix “B”</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Planning Assumptions</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Resumption of hostilities in Korea will be due to Communist action.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>The broad mission of the UNC is to obtain
                        a military victory.</item>
                    <pb facs="0511" n="1629" xml:id="pg1629"/>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Enemy forces in North Korea may have been augmented since 1 August 1953,
                        especially air forces.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Combat effectiveness of ROK-U.S.-UNC Forces will be maintained.</item>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>ROK forces will remain under UNC.</item>
                    <label>6.</label>
                    <item>Sufficient atomic weapons and suitable delivery means will be made
                        available.</item>
                    <label>7.</label>
                    <item>Provision for attacks on targets in the Dairen-Port Arthur area will be
                        included in the plans. Specific approval by the Joint Chiefs of Staff will
                        be required prior to implementation of such attacks.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
